      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Automatic spoken language detection: Meet automatically detects the language being spoken and translates it into each listener's preferred language in near real-time, even when multiple languages are spoken in the same meeting or when a speaker switches languages.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/real-time-speech-translation-in-google-Meet-expands-to-63-languages-with-automatic-language-detection.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
