        "checkedAt": "2026-10-25T00:17:22.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Individual participant controls: Instead of a meeting-wide configuration, participants can independently enable speech translation for themselves using the dedicated translation control in the meeting toolbar, and optionally configure additional languages they already understa…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/real-time-speech-translation-in-google-Meet-expands-to-63-languages-with-automatic-language-detection.html",
